{"id":253770,"shortDescription":"Catch the bus and let it take you to a detailed, virtual world.Are you ready to explore a picturesque German city behind the wheel of a realistically modeled, freely accessible bus? Then take a look at “Bus Simulator 2012” by the well-known developer studio TML!Every technical detail of the original bus has been reproduced true-to-live.","developers":["TML-Studios"],"publishers":["astragon Entertainment"],"categories":["Un jugador","Compat. parcial con mando","Incluye editor de niveles","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"22 NOV 2013","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/253770?t=1768874355","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/253770/ss_cf6b822e85f7cc7505cd131271083c9d72bfc46a.600x338.jpg?t=1768874355","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/253770/ss_cf6b822e85f7cc7505cd131271083c9d72bfc46a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768874355"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/253770/ss_620686273bcacc2cacea6ece124a399403cc953b.600x338.jpg?t=1768874355","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/253770/ss_620686273bcacc2cacea6ece124a399403cc953b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768874355"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/253770/ss_a6f35b510348185a51d5f1174be2efc2714f21cf.600x338.jpg?t=1768874355","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/253770/ss_a6f35b510348185a51d5f1174be2efc2714f21cf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768874355"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/253770/ss_cb95bbacf6958d49a49a27aa3126baa82a235b2c.600x338.jpg?t=1768874355","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/253770/ss_cb95bbacf6958d49a49a27aa3126baa82a235b2c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768874355"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste